ter the momentum and weight of your character and weapon together to fight effectively. It’s easy to pick up but leaves a lot of space for mastery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/1d24dc163726ca06d7dd0c21cd188547.poster.avif?t=1512694861\" width=202 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/1d24dc163726ca06d7dd0c21cd188547.webm?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/1d24dc163726ca06d7dd0c21cd188547.mp4?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/28056d24bbbd5ae59a1adafd4c815025.poster.avif?t=1512694861\" width=202 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/28056d24bbbd5ae59a1adafd4c815025.webm?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/28056d24bbbd5ae59a1adafd4c815025.mp4?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/ce08c148a053d4de5bb22fda32c008b7.poster.avif?t=1512694861\" width=202 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/ce08c148a053d4de5bb22fda32c008b7.webm?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467900/extras/ce08c148a053d4de5bb22fda32c008b7.mp4?t=1512694861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></